    "detailed_description": "Looking for a fun and exciting party game to play with your friends? Look no further than BoostHead! This fast-paced brawler game is all about challenging your friends to see who's the best, with no story to get in the way of the action.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn BoostHead, up to four players can battle it out in a variety of challenging arenas, using a range of special moves and power-ups to gain the upper hand. Whether you're knocking your opponents off the edge of the screen or smashing them with a power-up, there's always something new and exciting happening in BoostHead.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith its intuitive controls and addictive gameplay, BoostHead is the perfect party game for players of all skill levels. Whether you're a seasoned brawler or a newbie just looking to have some fun, BoostHead has something for everyone.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Grab your controllers and get ready to brawl with BoostHead! With its non-stop action and endless variety, this ultimate party game is sure to keep you and your friends entertained for hours on end.",
    "about_the_game": "Looking for a fun and exciting party game to play with your friends? Look no further than BoostHead! This fast-paced brawler game is all about challenging your friends to see who's the best, with no story to get in the way of the action.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn BoostHead, up to four players can battle it out in a variety of challenging arenas, using a range of special moves and power-ups to gain the upper hand. Whether you're knocking your opponents off the edge of the screen or smashing them with a power-up, there's always something new and exciting happening in BoostHead.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith its intuitive controls and addictive gameplay, BoostHead is the perfect party game for players of all skill levels. Whether you're a seasoned brawler or a newbie just looking to have some fun, BoostHead has something for everyone.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Grab your controllers and get ready to brawl with BoostHead! With its non-stop action and endless variety, this ultimate party game is sure to keep you and your friends entertained for hours on end.",
    "short_description": "BoostHead is a party brawler for up to four players. Battle it out in arenas using special moves and power-ups. BoostHead is perfect for players of all skill levels and is the ultimate party game for those seeking a fun and exciting experience with friends.",
